add_tb_termini_distance_loss() gains an order='binder-target'|'target-binder'
parameter selecting which pair of termini the loss pulls together, matching
binder_pipeline's fuse --order convention. Default 'binder-target' preserves
the previous hardcoded behaviour (target N-terminus <-> binder C-terminus).
